      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 601</b></color></size>\n<b>Nalanda Mahavihara</b>\n<size=74%>5th \u2013 12th century CE\n<i>Brick monastery and temple ruins</i>\nIn situ, Nalanda, Bihar (UNESCO World Heritage Site)</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nFounded under the Guptas in the 5th century, Nalanda grew into a great Buddhist monastic university with thousands of monks and teachers, drawing scholars such as Xuanzang from China. It flourished for some seven hundred years before its decline and destruction around 1200.</size>"
